OL,3,GNEWSAMagician devastated as bag pulls
OL,4,Adisappearing act
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn award-winning magician said his bag
OL,7,Fof tricks had done a disappearing act
OL,8,Fof its own, putting his livelihood at
OL,9,Frisk.
OL,11,FMatthew Le Mottee, from Cambridge, said
OL,12,Fhe was preparing to perform in the city
OL,13,Fat about 14:40 BST on Saturday, when
OL,14,Fhis brown leather bag was taken from
OL,15,Foutside a hotel.
OL,17,FHe said he reported the theft to the
OL,18,Fpolice, spent an hour sifting through
OL,19,Fnearby bins, and had since scoured
OL,20,Fhedges in the area, but has yet to be
OL,21,Freunited with the bag.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
