OL,3,GNEWSAMagician devastated as bag pulls
OL,4,Adisappearing act
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've got clients who are looking
OL,7,Fforward to seeing me and I have no
OL,8,Fprops at the moment," the magician told
OL,9,FChris Mann on BBC Radio Cambridgeshire.
